<title>USA: Coflexip buys stake in Cal Dive.</title>
<headline>Coflexip buys stake in Cal Dive.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-02-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Coflexip Stena Offshore said on Tuesday it signed a letter of intent to acquire a 32-percent stake in Cal Dive International Inc for $35 million, and to form an alliance with Cal Dive to pursue opportunities in the Gulf of Mexico.</p>
<p>The deal, if it receives regulatory approval, is expected to be final by the end of March.</p>
<p>The two firms would form a joint venture to pursue projects in deep-water oil and natural gas fields in the Gulf. Cal Dive is based in Houston, while Coflexip is headquartered in Paris.</p>
<p>((-- New York Newsdesk 212 859-1610))</p>
